{"channelId":"UCor1z3fwMOWcpxKM4mr7yww","row":["Besso Clinic of Chiropractic, Inc.",201,"At Besso Clinic of Chiropractic in Stow, Ohio we use extremely precise advanced Upper Cervical Chiropractic techniques to improve the health and life of our patients. \n\nUpper Cervical Chiropractic care is a very gentle technique that does not utilize twisting, popping or cracking. Our safe approach has proved extremely effective for those suffering from a variety of chronic conditions including migraines, vertigo, fibromyalgia, back pain, neck pain, TMJ and more. \n\nTo schedule a consultation with Dr. Geoff Besso please call 330-689-1234\nTo learn more about our practice visit our website at https://bessoclinic.com/\n\nWe would love to see if our unique form of care can help you find the relief you have been looking for.\n\nIf would like to learn even more about Upper Cervical Care please visit https://uppercervicalawareness.com/","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCor1z3fwMOWcpxKM4mr7yww","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCor1z3fwMOWcpxKM4mr7yww","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:16.395Z","channelId":"UCor1z3fwMOWcpxKM4mr7yww","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"19c634d87764ae884d330014af2f534fdcae16b9dd024f6a834b33b4dd908e94","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"227b36defcdc4f16e3102456fd33a1f153e6717d62336c06cc873206acf2fa2a"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCor1z3fwMOWcpxKM4mr7yww","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:16.395Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCor1z3fwMOWcpxKM4mr7yww","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":201,"raw":"201 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCor1z3fwMOWcpxKM4mr7yww","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:16.395Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["chiropractors"],"relevantKeywords":["chiropractors"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"ke